<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19022" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fūmĭgo</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. a. and n.
		fumus-ago. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>to smoke</i>, <i>to fumigate</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alvos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 3, 16, 17</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Col. 9, 14, 7</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gallinaria,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					8, 5, 20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(pulli) pulegii surculis fumigentur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					8, 5, 16</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fumigati parietes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. Mag. p. 312, 16</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>, <i>to produce smoke</i>,
				<i>to smoke</i>, <i>steam.</i>
			caelum atrum et fumigantes globi, <i><span class="en">Gell. 19,
				1, 3</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
